         -* ICY VIEW #VERSION *-

A modern text art and retro media viewer.

- Written in pure rust
- Multi platform Windows, OSX, Linux
- ANSI, ASCII, ADF, Avatar, BIN, XBIN,
  PCBoard, iCE, Tundra Draw, RIPscrip,
  C64 SEQ, IcyDraw & REXPaint formats
- Images, Sixel, PCX, Amiga IFF & BSAVE
- TheDraw, FIGlet & bitmap font previews
- Windows, Amiga & BGI font specimens
- MOD, S3M, XM, IT & RAD tracker playback
- MP3, Ogg, FLAC, WAV & AAC/M4A audio
- Browse folders & nested archives
- Browse & download Sixteen Colors art
- Thumbnail grid, search, sorting & ratings
- Slideshows & simulated baud playback
- Zoom, panning, minimap & auto-scroll
- SAUCE inspection & format-aware export
- 3D accelerated with CRT effects
- Copy & Paste

For latest builds/development visit:
GitHub https://github.com/mkrueger/icy_tools
